{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21526216",
      "title": "Named Slots",
      "lectureOrder": 115,
      "videoOrder": 98,
      "sourceHash": "aa9e498492be4d21a9ad32c3086c60f37415d8bdf8a4707812111376d61c8769",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.14,
          "end": 3.99,
          "en": "So now that we learned about slots,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.99,
          "end": 6.93,
          "en": "we can of course use our base-card slot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.93,
          "end": 9.01,
          "en": "also here in the BadgeList.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.01,
          "end": 11.26,
          "en": "There, I also got a section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.26,
          "end": 13.33,
          "en": "which should have this card look.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.33,
          "end": 16.48,
          "en": "So we can remove this section styling here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.48,
          "end": 17.99,
          "en": "not the h2 styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.99,
          "end": 20.56,
          "en": "I wanna keep that exclusive to this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.56,
          "end": 21.89,
          "en": "but the section styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.98,
          "end": 27.78,
          "en": "and then use our base-card component here to wrap this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.78,
          "end": 30.903,
          "en": "on all the list in the h2 tag in our case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.47,
          "end": 36.29,
          "en": "So use base-card as a wrapper around this content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.29,
          "end": 39.8,
          "en": "and that will now ensure that again it looks like before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.8,
          "end": 42.96,
          "en": "but now we have this re-usable card component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.96,
          "end": 45.603,
          "en": "and we can use it wherever we need that look.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.05,
          "end": 50.25,
          "en": "But that's not even all, you can use slots for it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.25,
          "end": 53.42,
          "en": "It is nice that we're able to pass dynamic content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.42,
          "end": 57.43,
          "en": "between the opening and closing tags of our own component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.43,
          "end": 60.1,
          "en": "But sometimes you also have the scenario",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.1,
          "end": 64.063,
          "en": "that your custom component should have multiple slots.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.16,
          "end": 66.84,
          "en": "And actually, I can show this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.84,
          "end": 68.66,
          "en": "at the example of this BaseCard.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.66,
          "end": 71.82,
          "en": "At the moment it has one slot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.82,
          "end": 73.55,
          "en": "but it would not be unrealistic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.55,
          "end": 75.41,
          "en": "that it should have two slots,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.41,
          "end": 78.94,
          "en": "let's say one slot for the header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.94,
          "end": 81.123,
          "en": "and one slot for the main content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.97,
          "end": 86.28,
          "en": "So here in BaseCard, we could add a header component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.92,
          "end": 90.34,
          "en": "to ensure that we always have the same structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.34,
          "end": 92.41,
          "en": "for every card, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.41,
          "end": 96.893,
          "en": "and then here, we also want to add a slot like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.46000000000001,
          "end": 100.93,
          "en": "But of course now we have two slots",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.93,
          "end": 103.84,
          "en": "and therefore Vue wouldn't really know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.84,
          "end": 106.5,
          "en": "where the provided content should go.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.5,
          "end": 109.53999999999999,
          "en": "So that's why if you use more than one slot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.53999999999999,
          "end": 112.2,
          "en": "you can add names to slots",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.2,
          "end": 115.763,
          "en": "with the name, attribute on the slot element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.66,
          "end": 120.28,
          "en": "And here we could give this a name of header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.28,
          "end": 121.69,
          "en": "but that name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.69,
          "end": 123.1,
          "en": "It can be anything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.1,
          "end": 126.1,
          "en": "doesn't have to be the wrapping elements' name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.1,
          "end": 128.51,
          "en": "You don't have to name all slots.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.51,
          "end": 130.93,
          "en": "If you leave one unnamed slot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 130.93,
          "end": 133.01,
          "en": "that will be the default slot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 133.01,
          "end": 136.99,
          "en": "but you must only have one unnamed slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 136.99,
          "end": 141.06,
          "en": "And now you can assign the content to the different slots,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.06,
          "end": 143.15,
          "en": "for example in UserInfo,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 143.15,
          "end": 147.51,
          "en": "we could now go to our header here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 147.51,
          "end": 150.8,
          "en": "and now here I want to tell Vue that this content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.8,
          "end": 152.79,
          "en": "the h3 tag and the base tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.79,
          "end": 154.9,
          "en": "should go to the header slot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 154.9,
          "end": 159.11,
          "en": "and for that you wrap it with a template tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 159.11,
          "end": 162.12,
          "en": "which is a default HTML element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 162.12,
          "end": 164.32,
          "en": "and on that template tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 164.32,
          "end": 167.56,
          "en": "which holds the content that should go into your name slot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.56,
          "end": 172.17000000000002,
          "en": "you add a special directive, the v-slot directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 172.17000000000002,
          "end": 175.91,
          "en": "The v-slot directive can be used to let Vue know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 175.91,
          "end": 178.223,
          "en": "where certain content should go to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.87,
          "end": 182.64,
          "en": "Now, you will let Vue know where the content should go to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.64,
          "end": 185.36,
          "en": "by adding an argument to this directive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 185.36,
          "end": 187.37,
          "en": "which you do by adding a colon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.37,
          "end": 189.78,
          "en": "and then the name of your slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 189.78,
          "end": 193.91,
          "en": "Now I have a named slot with a name of header here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 193.91,
          "end": 197.88,
          "en": "and therefore we can add header as an argument here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 197.88,
          "end": 201.38,
          "en": "And this tells Vue that the content inside of the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 201.38,
          "end": 203.083,
          "en": "will go to this named slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 204.47,
          "end": 205.49,
          "en": "Now as a side note,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 205.49,
          "end": 208.12,
          "en": "the template is a default HTML tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 208.12,
          "end": 210.76,
          "en": "which doesn't render anything to the screen though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 210.76,
          "end": 212.983,
          "en": "which is why we use it as a container here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 214.06,
          "end": 215.92000000000002,
          "en": "Now, if you then have content left,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215.92000000000002,
          "end": 218.79,
          "en": "which is not in a template with the slot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.79,
          "end": 222.763,
          "en": "that content will automatically go to the default slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 223.82,
          "end": 225.48,
          "en": "So if I save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 225.48,
          "end": 227.51,
          "en": "it looks almost like before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 227.51,
          "end": 229.35,
          "en": "but we can tell that something changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 229.35,
          "end": 231.47,
          "en": "because now the label, the badge here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 231.47,
          "end": 233.89,
          "en": "is no longer next to the name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 233.89,
          "end": 236.07,
          "en": "and it is no longer next to the name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 236.07,
          "end": 239.2,
          "en": "because we no longer have the header here in UserInfo,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 239.2,
          "end": 242.31,
          "en": "instead, we have the template where we sent this content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 242.31,
          "end": 244.113,
          "en": "into the header of BaseCard.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 246.09,
          "end": 248.18,
          "en": "And since the header's styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 248.18,
          "end": 249.57,
          "en": "which was responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 249.57,
          "end": 252.25,
          "en": "for placing the badge next to the title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 252.25,
          "end": 256.53,
          "en": "is still in UserInfo and is scoped to this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 256.53,
          "end": 260.67,
          "en": "it does not affect the header in BaseCard.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 260.67,
          "end": 262.47,
          "en": "We're going to take care about styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 262.47,
          "end": 263.93,
          "en": "in the next lecture though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 263.93,
          "end": 265.52,
          "en": "Before we do that, however,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 265.52,
          "end": 267.58,
          "en": "let me go to BadgeList",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 267.58,
          "end": 271.66,
          "en": "and here I want to send this h2 tag into the header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 271.66,
          "end": 273.493,
          "en": "So again, we need a template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 276.18,
          "end": 280.52,
          "en": "wrap h2 with it, and then add v-slot:header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 280.52,
          "end": 285.31,
          "en": "You can also be more explicit about the fact that this here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 285.31,
          "end": 287.84000000000003,
          "en": "the rest will go into the default slot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 287.84000000000003,
          "end": 289.58299999999997,
          "en": "by adding a template here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 290.46,
          "end": 292.54,
          "en": "adding a template around that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 292.54,
          "end": 295.94,
          "en": "and then adding v-slot:default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 295.94,
          "end": 297.94,
          "en": "Default is a reserve name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 297.94,
          "end": 299.23,
          "en": "and like the name implies,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 299.23,
          "end": 301.893,
          "en": "it always targets the default slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 303.21,
          "end": 304.61,
          "en": "So I'm going to do this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 304.61,
          "end": 306.8,
          "en": "and also in the UserInfo component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 306.8,
          "end": 309.89,
          "en": "to be very clear about which content goes where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 309.89,
          "end": 312.56,
          "en": "and to make it obvious that I did not forget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 312.56,
          "end": 314.74,
          "en": "to assign this to any slot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 314.74,
          "end": 317.843,
          "en": "but that I want this to go to the default slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 319.01,
          "end": 321.97,
          "en": "So that's why I add this default slot template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 321.97,
          "end": 325.52,
          "en": "to both UserInfo and BadgeList here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 325.52,
          "end": 327.68,
          "en": "But with that, that's what we got.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 327.68,
          "end": 330.28,
          "en": "Now let's explore the styling here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 330.28,
          "end": 333.563,
          "en": "and let's see how we can fix this when working with slots.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
